{"id":"96add5833bb7dcac","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-lambda-substitution.md","title":"避免捕获的 λ 替换","display":"df-lambda-substitution — 避免捕获的 λ 替换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-lambda-substitution","aliases":["56-df-lambda-substitution"],"display":"df-lambda-substitution — 避免捕获的 λ 替换","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-term]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 10.1.8 and Remark 10.1.9, printed p550","source_ocr_block":"571","source_status":"source-compared; capture-conditions-made-explicit"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-lambda-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-lambda-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lambda-substitution — 避免捕获的 λ 替换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 10.1.8 and Remark 10.1.9, printed p550"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"571"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-compared; capture-conditions-made-explicit"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a> 的原始项、各允许改名等价类的枚举与关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,M_1,M_2\">\\(M,N,M_1,M_2\\)</span> 为原始项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span>；常元分支仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span> 给出，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 非空。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta_E\">\\(\\zeta_E\\)</span> 的输入域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\times V^2\">\\((\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\times V^2\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>-类无限而有限项的全变量集有限。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,F,E)\">\\(\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,F,E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n,q\\in\\Lambda\">\\(m,n,q\\in\\Lambda\\)</span> 表示 α 等价类。原始项替换与商上替换使用相同方括号记法，由输入所在集合区分；商上函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}\">\\(\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}\\)</span> 的参数次序是被替换项、变量、代入项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y)\\coloneqq\nv^{[y]_E}_{\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:v_j^{[y]_E}\\notin\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{AV}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y)\\coloneqq\nv^{[y]_E}_{\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:v_j^{[y]_E}\\notin\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{AV}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x[x:=N]\\coloneqq N,\\qquad y[x:=N]\\coloneqq y\\quad(y\\ne x),\\qquad f[x:=N]\\coloneqq f\\quad(f\\in F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x[x:=N]\\coloneqq N,\\qquad y[x:=N]\\coloneqq y\\quad(y\\ne x),\\qquad f[x:=N]\\coloneqq f\\quad(f\\in F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(M_1M_2)[x:=N]\\coloneqq(M_1[x:=N])(M_2[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(M_1M_2)[x:=N]\\coloneqq(M_1[x:=N])(M_2[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda y.M)[x:=N]\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\lambda y.M&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\lambda y.(M[x:=N])&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(N),\\\\\n\\lambda\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y).((\\pi_{y,\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y)}\\cdot M)[x:=N])&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\mathrm{FV}(N).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\lambda y.M)[x:=N]\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\lambda y.M&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\lambda y.(M[x:=N])&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(N),\\\\\n\\lambda\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y).((\\pi_{y,\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y)}\\cdot M)[x:=N])&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\mathrm{FV}(N).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M,M&#39;,N,N&#39;\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M&#39;\\land N\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N&#39;\\Longrightarrow M[x:=N]\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M&#39;[x:=N&#39;]\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M,M&#39;,N,N&#39;\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M&#39;\\land N\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N&#39;\\Longrightarrow M[x:=N]\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M&#39;[x:=N&#39;]\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{((m,x,n),q)\\in(\\Lambda\\times V\\times\\Lambda)\\times\\Lambda:\\exists M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;(m=[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\land n=[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\land q=[M[x:=N]]_{\\alpha,E})\\bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{((m,x,n),q)\\in(\\Lambda\\times V\\times\\Lambda)\\times\\Lambda:\\exists M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;(m=[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\land n=[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\land q=[M[x:=N]]_{\\alpha,E})\\bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}:\\Lambda\\times V\\times\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda,\\qquad m[x:=n]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}(m,x,n),\\qquad [M]_{\\alpha,E}[x:=[N]_{\\alpha,E}]=[M[x:=N]]_{\\alpha,E}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}:\\Lambda\\times V\\times\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda,\\qquad m[x:=n]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}(m,x,n),\\qquad [M]_{\\alpha,E}[x:=[N]_{\\alpha,E}]=[M[x:=N]]_{\\alpha,E}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 10.1.8 与 Remark 10.1.9（印刷 p550，OCR 页块571）把无捕获条件作为变量约定；这里把条件移入正式分支。递归调用的项都比外层抽象小；交换变量不改变树大小。不同合法新鲜变量得到 α 等价结果。断言现显式给出代表元独立性和商上函数图；每对等价类有代表元，因此图处处有值，代表元独立性保证单值。独立性可按无捕获替换的结构递归核对：变量、常元和应用分支直接保持；抽象分支先在该绑定变量的 E 类中选一个同时避开两侧全部出现变量的新鲜变量，把两侧绑定变量都改名为它，再对体使用归纳结论。替换项改用 α 等价代表元时，同样先避开双方出现变量；新鲜变量选择造成的差异仅为允许的 α 改名。这一论证也适用于按类型划分的 E，因为只在原绑定变量的 E 类内改名。此操作用于自由变量替换，不能与允许捕获的上下文填孔混淆。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的原始项、各允许改名等价类的枚举与关系 $E$。$M,N,M_1,M_2$ 为原始项，$x,y\\in V$；常元分支仅对 $f\\in F$ 给出，不要求 $F$ 非空。函数 $\\zeta_E$ 的输入域为 $(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\times V^2$；每个 $E$-类无限而有限项的全变量集有限。令 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,F,E)$；$m,n,q\\in\\Lambda$ 表示 α 等价类。原始项替换与商上替换使用相同方括号记法，由输入所在集合区分；商上函数 $\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}$ 的参数次序是被替换项、变量、代入项。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"M,N,M_1,M_2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta_E","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\times V^2","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,F,E)","display":false},{"tex":"m,n,q\\in\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y)\\coloneqq\nv^{[y]_E}_{\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:v_j^{[y]_E}\\notin\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{AV}(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}}.","display":true},{"tex":"x[x:=N]\\coloneqq N,\\qquad y[x:=N]\\coloneqq y\\quad(y\\ne x),\\qquad f[x:=N]\\coloneqq f\\quad(f\\in F).","display":true},{"tex":"(M_1M_2)[x:=N]\\coloneqq(M_1[x:=N])(M_2[x:=N]).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\lambda y.M)[x:=N]\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\lambda y.M&y=x,\\\\\n\\lambda y.(M[x:=N])&y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(N),\\\\\n\\lambda\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y).((\\pi_{y,\\zeta_E(M,N,x,y)}\\cdot M)[x:=N])&y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\mathrm{FV}(N).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall M,M',N,N'\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M'\\land N\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N'\\Longrightarrow M[x:=N]\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}M'[x:=N']\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{((m,x,n),q)\\in(\\Lambda\\times V\\times\\Lambda)\\times\\Lambda:\\exists M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;(m=[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\land n=[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\land q=[M[x:=N]]_{\\alpha,E})\\bigr\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}:\\Lambda\\times V\\times\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda,\\qquad m[x:=n]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}(m,x,n),\\qquad [M]_{\\alpha,E}[x:=[N]_{\\alpha,E}]=[M[x:=N]]_{\\alpha,E}.","display":true}],"bytes":3238,"backlinks":[{"id":"650401013847f443","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的 $\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$ 与 $\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}$，替换见 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]]。$\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta$ 在原始项上定义，再按代表元存在量化下降到 α 商；用同一符号表示。$\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)$ 在断言中展开，是应用及抽象下的闭包条件。"},{"id":"c7d107c2c14774de","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e75dc86b680683eb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无常元无类型实例，令 $L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)$、$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_{\\alpha,V^2}$。$M,N,P\\in L$、$x\\in V$，$m\\in\\Lambda$。$\\operatorname{Dev}:L\\to L$ 按有限原始项树递归；替换取 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的原始项函数。"},{"id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在无类型无常元 λ 演算中，$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$。项及构造按 α 商解释，$M[x:=N]$ 使用 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 中正式构造的 $\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)$。下列关系 $P_n\\subseteq\\Lambda^2$ 按 $n\\in\\mathbb N$ 分层构造，$x\\in V$。"},{"id":"72b587eaf1edf078","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无类型无常元实例，令 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda^2$ 为其中的同时归约。$M,M',N,N'\\in\\Lambda$，$x\\in V$。$M[x:=N]=\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)$ 为 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的商上无捕获替换；其代表元独立性、改名规则和输入域沿用该内部定义。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-substitution.md]]"},{"id":"724872afe5c644b4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d547d7414660f6bd"]}